  "html": "<p>Writing, working code and experiments from different corners of my work. Start with an idea, follow it into a project, and bring what you learn back to your own practice.</p>\n<h2>Three places to start</h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/2026/02/14/build-a-python-coding-agent-in-30-minutes/\">Build a Python Coding Agent in 30 Minutes</a> — follow the article, then explore its source code below.</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/Harness-Engineering\">Harness Engineering</a> — learn how context and verification shape an agent’s results.</li><li><a href=\"/2026/08/11/introducing-odia-panjika-%e0%ac%93%e0%ac%a1%e0%ac%bc%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%86-%e0%ac%aa%e0%ac%9e%e0%ad%8d%e0%ac%9c%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%95%e0%ac%be-bridging-odishas-cultural-rhythm-with-modern-technolo/\">The story behind Odia Panjika</a> — explore the intersection of technology, language and culture.</li></ol>\n<h2>Projects and practical resources</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/Harness-Engineering\">Harness Engineering</a></h3><p>A practical handbook, assessment templates and an executable booking lab for testing the environment around AI coding agents. Start with the handbook, then try the local failure-to-fix demonstration.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/PythonAgent\">Python Coding Agent</a></h3><p>A command-line experiment that turns natural-language requirements into Python code, with conversation support and usage tracking. Pair the code with the step-by-step article on this site.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/Odia-Panchang\">Odia Panchang</a></h3><p>A bilingual Odia and English calendar API exploring regional festivals, temple traditions and astronomical calculations. Read the project story, then explore the API and implementation.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/astro-coach\">Jyotish Coach</a></h3><p>An application combining a web interface, an astronomical calculation service and AI-assisted coaching.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/Bangla-Calendar\">Bangla Calendar</a></h3><p>A calendar application repository with separate frontend and backend components.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/lipsa\">LIPSA</a></h3><p>An experimental local tool for organizing imported professional-network posts, with data provenance and audit records. The project is marked alpha.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977/SocialMeditPostingApp\">Social Media Beautifier</a></h3><p>A browser-based social-post formatting experiment.</p>\n<h2>Recent writing on Medium</h2>\n<p>These stories open on Medium. Some require a Medium membership.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/the-waiting-room-363f869ab31c\">The Waiting Room</a><br/>hope, mental health, anxiety</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/the-reliability-shift-why-typesafe-ai-changes-the-game-for-enterprise-automation-0e468aba89a1\">The Reliability Shift: Why TypeSafe AI Changes the Game for Enterprise Automation</a><br/>artificial intelligence, software engineering, ai agent</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/the-agents-lost-harness-why-your-instructions-fail-in-new-sessions-6f02375345b3\">The Agent’s Lost Harness: Why Your Instructions Fail in New Sessions</a><br/>artificial intelligence, github copilot, software engineering</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/the-harness-not-the-model-what-engineering-leaders-still-miss-about-ai-coding-cbc4d1cd6117\">The Harness, Not the Model: What Engineering Leaders Still Miss About AI Coding</a><br/>large language models, ai agent, ai engineering</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/the-multi-agent-debate-and-other-heresies-contrarian-voices-in-ai-coding-c913382f6bbf\">The Multi-Agent Debate and Other Heresies: Contrarian Voices in AI Coding</a><br/>ai coding, ai agent, software engineering</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/the-harness-is-the-product-context-engineering-as-enterprise-discipline-bddc2795089d\">The Harness Is the Product: Context Engineering as Enterprise Discipline</a><br/>engineering leadership, software architecture, ai coding</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/ten-schools-of-ai-coding-a-github-cartography-of-2026-049c144b1313\">Ten Schools of AI Coding: A GitHub Cartography of 2026</a><br/>developer tools, ai coding, context engineering</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/building-evals-for-ai-agents-is-hard-here-is-the-practical-playbook-07af68fd6de3\">Building Evals for AI Agents Is Hard; Here Is the Practical Playbook</a><br/>machine learning, langchain, ai agent</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/agentic-engineering-patterns-from-code-as-expensive-to-code-as-infrastructure-fe004e4bac6f\">Agentic Engineering Patterns: From Code as Expensive to Code as Infrastructure</a><br/>agentic ai, engineering leadership, artificial intelligence</p></li>\n<li><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi/beyond-the-prompt-master-the-5-essential-agentic-ai-design-patterns-with-langgraph-489892444a8d\">Beyond the Prompt: Master the 5 Essential Agentic AI Design Patterns with LangGraph</a><br/>artificial intelligence, python, ai agent</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@sakti.bagchi\">More on Medium</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/sakti1977\">More on GitHub</a></p>",
